---
import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Support"
  description="Get help with LittlePickle leagues, queues, profiles, QR codes, and account requests."
>
  <section>
    <h2>Contact LittlePickle</h2>
    <p>
      Email <a href="mailto:support@joinlittlepickle.com">support@joinlittlepickle.com</a> for product,
      account, privacy, or accessibility support.
    </p>
    <div class="legal-actions">
      <a class="legal-button" href="mailto:support@joinlittlepickle.com?subject=LittlePickle%20support">
        Email support
      </a>
      <a class="legal-button legal-button--secondary" href="/account-deletion/">Delete an account</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Help us resolve your issue</h2>
    <p>Include the following when it is relevant:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>What you were trying to do and what happened instead.</li>
      <li>Your iPhone or iPad model and iOS or iPadOS version.</li>
      <li>The LittlePickle app version.</li>
      <li>The league name and an approximate time the issue occurred.</li>
      <li>A screenshot that does not expose private information.</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="legal-note">
      <p><strong>Never email your verification code, password, or private authentication link.</strong></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Common questions</h2>

    <h3>How do I join a league queue?</h3>
    <p>
      Scan the league’s LittlePickle QR code with the in-app scanner or search for the league from the Home
      screen, then select or create your player profile.
    </p>

    <h3>Why does LittlePickle request camera access?</h3>
    <p>
      Camera access is used only to scan league QR codes. You can search for a league without granting
      camera access.
    </p>

    <h3>Why does LittlePickle request photo access?</h3>
    <p>
      Photo access lets you select an optional profile picture or save a league QR code. The queue works
      without a profile picture.
    </p>

    <h3>How do I delete a player profile?</h3>
    <p>
      Open Profile, select <strong>Delete profile</strong>, and confirm. The profile becomes unavailable
      immediately and is permanently anonymized after the 30-day recovery period.
    </p>

    <h3>How do I delete my LittlePickle account?</h3>
    <p>
      Open Profile, open <strong>Settings</strong>, select <strong>Delete account</strong>, and confirm.
      Account access is disabled immediately and the authentication account is permanently deleted after
      30 days.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Policies</h2>
    <p>
      Review the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>, <a href="/terms/">Terms of Use</a>, or
      <a href="/legal/">Legal hub</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
